# Paths Semgrep (.github/workflows/sast.yml) skips. This file replaces
# Semgrep's built-in defaults, so the ones that apply here are restated.

# Dependencies and build output.
node_modules/
dist/
vendor/

# Tests and their fixtures, as in Semgrep's defaults.
testdata/
*_test.go
*.test.ts
*.test.tsx
*.test.mjs

# Generated data (development/generate-logo): raw color tables, no logic.
*_generated.go

# Helm templates are not YAML until rendered; the iac job renders the chart
# and Checkov scans the resulting manifests.
charts/*/templates/
